<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MAL" style="id">Malaki</book>
  <para style="h">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malaki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malaki</para>
  <para style="mt">Malaki</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kiang a Toupa kilakna Malaki in a muh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka hon itta,” Toupa’n a chi. Nou bel, “Koilai ah ahia nang kou n’on ittak?” na chi uhi, “Esau, Jakob unaupa ahi kei maw? Hinapi in, Jakob ka it hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Esau ka hua a, a tangsangte ka hihgawp a, a goutan gamdai sehalte kiang ah ka peta hi, Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Edom in, “Suk zawngkhal in i om ua, himahleh i kiknawn ding ua mun segawpsate i lam ding uh” chi mahleh, hichibang in sepaihte Toupa’n “A lam nawn ding ua, himahleh ka chimsak ding; mite’n amaute gitlouhna gam leh, mipi a tung ua tangtawn a Toupa hehna nam” a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in na mitte un a mu dia, “Israel gamgi khen ah Toupa letsak in om hen” na chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tapa in a pa a zahtak a, sikha in a pu; huchi a pa ka hihleh, kei zahtakna koi a om ahia?” Huchi a pu ka hihleh, kei kihtakna kaw om ahia? Sepaihte Toupa’n na kiang uah a chi, siampu ka min musitte aw. Nou koilai ah ahia na min ka muhsit uh? na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka maitam tung ah tanghou sesa na lan ua, nou koilai ah ahia k’on hihnit uh? na chi uh. Toupa dohkan a simmohhuai, na chih na uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kithoihna ding a mittaw na lat un, gilou ahi kei maw? Khebai leh damlou na lat un, gilou ahi kei maw? Tuin na ukpipa kiang ah tawi in na tung ah a lungdam diam? Ahihkeileh nou hon deihsak diam?” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in tuin k’on ngen hi, i tung a a chitna na theihna ding in Pathian deihsakna ngen un. Hiai na khut ua kipan thilpiak toh nou hon deihsak diam? sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thawn a ka maitam tung a mei na tohlouhna ding un, na lak ua mi khat kongkhakte khak ding om leh aw; Sepaihte Toupa’n , “Nou ah kipahna ka neikei a, na khut ua kipan in thillat leng ka sangsam kei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni suahna a kipan ni tumna lam pha hial in leng Jentelte lak ah ka min a thupi hi, munchih ah ka min adin gimlim a kilan a, thillat siangthou; Jentelte lak a ka min a let ziak in, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Himahleh nou na hihnin ua, Toupa dohkan a nin a, huai a a gah toh a an nangawn a zahpihhuai na chih na uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Ngai un, a chimtakhuai na e; na chilai ua, huan na hahchhiau khum uh, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, hiamgam a lak gante n’on tawi ua, khebaite, damloute, huchibang in thillat na hontawi uhi; na khut ua kipan in hiai ka sang peuhmah ding hia?’ Toupa’n a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh a ganhon lak a a pa nei a, thuchiam a Toupa lak a thil demkai a kithoih, mikhempa hamsiat in om heh; Kumpipa thupi ka hi a, Jentelte lak ah ka min a lauhuai ngal a” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin, nou siampute aw, “Hiai thupiak nou ading ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka min pahtawi ding a, na ngaihkhiak kei ua, na lungtang ua na koih kei uleh, huchi in na tung uah hamsia ka tungsak ding a, na vualzawlnate uh ka hamsiat khum ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi, ahi, lungtang a na koihlouh ziak un, ka hamsiat khinta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, nou ziak in na chi tuh ka sal ding a, na mai uah ek ka theh thang ding a, na kithoihna ek ngei uh; huchi in huai toh lakmang in na om ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hiai thupiak, Levi toh ka thukhun a om theihna ding in, na kiang uah ka honsawlta chih na thei ding uh, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hinna leh lungmuanna ka thukhun amah toh a om hi, a kihtak theihna ding in a kiang ah a maute ka peta a, kei a hon kihta a, ka min a zahtak mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thudik a kam sung ah a om a, diktatlouhna a muk ah a kimu kei hi; lungmuanna leh tanna ah ka thu a zui a, gitlouhna a kipan in mi tampi a hei mangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Siampu mukte’n theihna a kem un, a kam uah danthu a zong ding uh ahi him hi; amah lah sepaihte Toupa sawltak ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Himahleh lampi a kipan a pialsak in na om ua; tampi dan ah na kisuipuk sak uhi; Levi thukhun na suseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka lampite na zuihlouh dungzui un, dan a mite deihsak tuam na neihzawk ziak un, ken leng mipite tengteng ma ah zahpihhuai leh dai in k’on bawlta hi, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I vek un pa khat i neikei ua hia? Pathian khat in honsiam ka hia? Bangdia lepchiah tak a michih in i pipute uh thukhun hihnin a unau siatna ding a hih i hi ua?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah in lepchiahtak in a hihta a, Israel ah leh Jerusalem ah kihhuai hih in a om hi, Judah in Pathian Mun Siangthou it a hihninta a, theihlouh pathian tanu a kitenpihta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Toupa’n hiai thilhihpa, sinsakpa leh sinsak a ompa, Jakob puanin a kipan leh sepaihte Toupa kiang a thillat lanpa a satkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huan hiai na hih nawn uh; Toupa maitam khitui, kah leh thumna in na khuh ua, thillat a limsak nawnlouh a, na khut ua kipan a deihsakna toh san leng a san nawnlouh tanpha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinapi in lah, bangding in? a chi uhi. Na tuailai zi, lepchiahtak a na bawl, na kithuahpihnu, na thukhun zi hinapi in, amah leh nang kikal ah Toupa theihpihpa a hih khittak ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian in nihte sa khat in honbawl kei maw? Khat in na kha hon bawlsak in, a hingsak kei maw? Bang a chia khat? Pathian limsak chi a zong ahi. Huaiziak in michih in a tuailai zi lepchiahtak a hihlou ding in na kha thu uah pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa Israel Pathian in a chi, koihmangna ka hua a, hiamgamna a puansilh khuh mipa ka mudah hi, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi. Huaiziak in, michih in a tuailai zi lepchiah tak a hihlou ding in, na kha thu uah pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na thu un Toupa na hihgimta uh, koi ah k’on hihgim ua eita na chilai uhi: michih gilou hih Toupa mitmuh in a hoih a, huaite ah amah a kipak hi na chihna uah leh vaihawmna Pathian kaw om hiam na chih nakna uah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai in, ka sawltak ka sawl a, aman ka ma ah lampi a bawlkhol ding a Toupa , na zon uh, a biakin ah thakhat in a hongpai ding; na kipahna uh, thukhun sawltak, ngai un, a honghi,” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh a hong paina ni kuan a thuakzou thei dia? A honglat chiang in kua a dingzou dia? Amah hihsiangthou mei leh sahbon bang ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in dangka hih siangthoumi leh siangsakmi bang in a tu ding a Levi tapate a hihsiang ding hi, dangkaeng leh dangka bang in amau a khuahsiang ding a, huchi in diktatna in Toupa kiang ah thillatte a lan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huaichiang in Judah leh Jerusalem thillatte nidanglai bang leh tang a kumte bang in Toupa ading in namtui a hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Huan vaihawmna ah aisanmite kalh in, angkawmte kalh in, zuau a kichiamte kalh in theihpihpa kin ka hi ding a, loh thu a migoih, meithai, nu leh pa bei, nuaisiah, a thuneihna a kipan mikhual kaiheipa, kei hon kihtaloute kalh in, na kiang uah ka hongding sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Kei Toupa ka zulhzau kei a; huaiziak in Jakob tapate aw, halbei in na omkei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na pipute uh damlai a kipan ka thusehte na kilehheisan ua, na zuikei uhi. Ka kiang ah hongkik unla, na kiang uah ka hongkik ding, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi. Himahleh nou, koi ah i kik ding ua? na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Min Pathian a lok diam? Hinapi in noute’n n’on lok uhi. Himahleh nou koi ah k’on lok ua eita? na chi uhi. Sawm a khatte ah leh thillat ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hiai nam pumpi in, kei n’on loh ziak un hamsiatna a hamsiat na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka inn sung a an a hongom theihna ding in koihkhomna inn ah sawm a khat avek in hon lalut unla, huai in kei hon entel un, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi hi. A koihna ding dantan kiching omlou khop in van tohlette hong in, vualzawlna k’on buakkhe kei na hiam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huan negaimi pen nou ziak in ka sal ding a, na leigahte uh a suse kei ding hi; na grepgui u leng lou ah a hun tunma in a gah a kesak kei ding hi, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in nam tengteng in nang nuamsa a honchi ding ua; gam kipahhuai na hih ding ziak un, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Kei dem a na thute uh a khauh hi” Toupa’n a chi. “Nou koi ah nang dem in thu ka gen ua eita” na chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Pathian nasep a thawn ahi”; a thupiak i zuih ua, sunna puan silh a sepaihte Toupa ma a i om uh bang a a phattuamna” chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin kisatheite nuamsa chi in, a gitlouhna nasemte tunding in a om uh; ahi; Pathian khemte hotkhiak in a om uh” i chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa kihtate a kihoupih ua; huchi in Toupa’n a ngaikhia a, a za a, Toupa kihta a, a min ngaihtuahte a ma uah theihgigena laibuzial ah gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Huan amau kei a a hi ding ua, gou lamdangtak ka bawl ni chiang in” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi. Min a nasem amah tapa a hawi bang in huchi in amau ka hawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai hun chiang in na hong kihei ding ua, diktatte leh giloute, Pathian nasem leh amah semloute kal na khenchian thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngai in, a ni a hongtun ziak in, meipi bang in a kuang a; huchi in kisatheite tengteng, gilou nasemte tengteng, buhpawl hi ding uh; huan a hongtung huai ni’n amaute zung leh hiang nuse lou hial in a kang mang ding uh” sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Himahleh nou ka min kihtate kiang ah diktatna ni, a khate a hihdamna toh a hongsuak ding; huchi in na pawtkhe ding ua, huangsung bawngnoute bang in na diang velhvelh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huan giloute na sikden ding ua; ka gamtat nichiang in na khepek nuai uah meivu ahi ding uh a hih ziak in, sepaihte Toupa’n a chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Horeb a Israel tengteng ading a ka sikha Mosi dan, amah thupiak, thusehte leh vaihawmte ngei, theigige un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ngai un, Toupa ni thupi leh mulkimhuai a hong tunma in zawlnei Elijah na kiang uah k’on sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pate lungtang tate lam ah, tate lungtang a pate uh lam ah a ngasak ding a; huchilou in zaw hamsia in lei ka gawt kha ding hi.”
  </para>
</usx>
